      "id": "Terapkan <strong>LUT 3D khusus</strong> ke layar atau filter video <strong>PIP dan streaming</strong>.",
      "it": "Applica <strong>LUT 3D personalizzate</strong> al display o ai filtri video per <strong>PIP e streaming</strong>.",
      "lv": "Lietojiet <strong>pielāgotus 3D LUT</strong> displejam vai <strong>PIP un straumēšanas</strong> video filtriem.",
      "nl": "Pas <strong>aangepaste 3D-LUT’s</strong> toe op je scherm of op videofilters voor <strong>PIP en streaming</strong>.",
      "nb": "Bruk <strong>egendefinerte 3D-LUT-er</strong> på skjermen eller i videofiltre for <strong>PIP og strømming</strong>.",
      "pl": "Stosuj <strong>własne tablice 3D LUT</strong> na wyświetlaczu lub w filtrach wideo dla <strong>PIP i strumieniowania</strong>.",
      "pt-BR": "Aplique <strong>LUTs 3D personalizadas</strong> à tela ou aos filtros de vídeo de <strong>PIP e transmissão</strong>.",
